flowchart LR
    accTitle: M6 review gate sequence
    accDescr: An explicitly selected Thermos pair returns findings to one CE review and CI loop. Existing review evidence supports an authorized merge and post-merge proof; no additional reviewer is implied.
    A["1 · Ready<br/>Diff + focused gates"] --> B["2 · Gates<br/>Quality preflight"]
    B --> C["3 · Thermos<br/>Selected review pair"]
    C --> D["4 · Return<br/>Synthesis sends fixes back"]
    D --> E["5 · Settle<br/>CE review + CI"]
    E --> F["6 · Review<br/>Existing evidence"]
    F --> G["7 · Merge<br/>Current authority"]
    G --> H["8 · Prove<br/>Post-merge check"]
    D -->|real findings| A
